			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740230201,
					"content": "唔…這裡的東西看著有點不順眼…總覺得跟之前碰到的那些醜東西有點像…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740230202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740230202,
					"content": "<color=#00E1FFFF>為什麼要把水元素方碑埋在地下啊</color>？完全搞不懂…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740230203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740230203,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，不如我們重新擺放一下？就像薩莎之前教我們的那樣！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
